{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfhNmrZUiGhA7W9xRLGVg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The race is fixed: only the most recent search can now update results, loading, or errors. The change is five lines in `src/search/controller.ts`.\n\n**Cause:** every `search()` call wrote its outcome into state when its request settled, regardless of whether a newer search (or a clear) had happened since.\n\n**Fix:** each `search()` call now takes a sequence number, and its results, error, and loading updates are applied only if it is still the latest call. Clearing the query also takes a number, so it resets state immediately and any request still in flight is ignored when it finishes. The public API, the API layer, and the view are unchanged.\n\n**Verification:**\n- The existing suite (`npm test`) passes, 4 of 4.\n- I also ran a throwaway race check with manually controlled promises, which passed. I deleted it afterwards, so the repo has no regression test for this bug.\n  - **Out-of-order completion:** with three overlapping searches, an early failure and a late stale success left the state on the latest query's results, with loading still on until that request finished.\n  - **Clear during flight:** clearing with two requests in flight reset state immediately, and their later completion changed nothing and notified no subscribers.\n\nStale requests are ignored, not cancelled, so the superseded HTTP calls still run to completion. Aborting them would mean passing an `AbortSignal` through `SearchApi.search`, which changes the interface, so I left it out.\n\nNothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1640,"cache_read_input_tokens":10221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1640},"output_tokens":466,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13950737-eb6e-46c2-b66c-1fdeaa3027cf","uuid":"d0d1681e-5853-467b-b853-2e7e50c0e32f","timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:44:48.488Z","request_id":"req_011CfhNmrENaXupnSuYWYzvQ"}
